-d7d491e381eecad8852957029d7afa00.jpg?v=1765827323","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/ud1c46n7d0/properties/d0f7b21ad9e411f09ebd02a3ded47a2d/w800/35-6634bba9ef9cdbd6a8fdecf4891493a0.jpg?v=1765827323","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/ud1c46n7d0/properties/d0f7b21ad9e411f09ebd02a3ded47a2d/w800/36-cb468076eeb5d00a9099b0ca3bad76e9.jpg?v=1765827323","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/ud1c46n7d0/properties/d0f7b21ad9e411f09ebd02a3ded47a2d/w800/37-aaefdd2df7a79ad55f87fd990177a358.jpg?v=1765827323","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/ud1c46n7d0/properties/d0f7b21ad9e411f09ebd02a3ded47a2d/w800/38-0664a8894a09e4a6c3d3d870d325bd66.jpg?v=1765827323","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/ud1c46n7d0/properties/d0f7b21ad9e411f09ebd02a3ded47a2d/w800/39-68e0e5f1b70841977d06546b56851153.jpg?v=1765827323","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/ud1c46n7d0/properties/d0f7b21ad9e411f09ebd02a3ded47a2d/w800/40-da75a3471d15f81fe0222b39bff0cc83.jpg?v=1765827323"],"descripcion":{"es":"Este excepcional ático dúplex exquisitamente diseñado y orientado al suroeste ofrece una impresionante vista panorámica de los preciosos jardines y alrededores de Las Alamandas, en en Nueva Andalucía, proporcionando un equilibrio ideal de sol y sombra a través de sus amplios espacios de terraza. Recientemente reformado con los más altos estándares contemporáneos e incorporando lo último en tecnología domótica, este extraordinario ático combina la privacidad, el lujo, la comodidad y la elegancia de vivir en una villa con el prestigio y el atractivo de residir en uno de los lugares más codiciados de Marbella.\n\nLa propiedad cuenta con una suite principal con vestidor, baño en-suite y sauna, junto con dos dormitorios adicionales, uno de ellos en-suite. Otras comodidades incluyen un amplio salón y comedor, un aseo de invitados, varias terrazas grandes, una cocina moderna totalmente equipada, acceso privado por ascensor, calefacción por suelo radiante, cortinas eléctricas, mosquiteras en todas las puertas, sistema ‌de ‌domótica ‌Gira ‌y ‌aparcamiento ‌subterráneo para ‌dos vehículos, ‌todo ello integrado con avanzados ‌sistemas ‌de ‌domótica.\n\nEl ‌complejo ‌ofrece una piscina climatizada ‌y ‌servicio ‌de ‌vigilante ‌las ‌24 ‌horas.","en":"This exceptional and exquisitely designed southwest-facing duplex penthouse offers a stunning panoramic view of the award-winning gardens of Las Alamandas, in Nueva Andalucía, providing an ideal balance of sun and shade across its expansive terrace spaces. Recently refurbished to the highest contemporary standards and incorporating the latest in home automation technology, this remarkable penthouse combines the privacy, luxury, comfort, and elegance of villa living with the added prestige and appeal of residing in one of Marbella’s most sought-after locations.\n\nThe property features a master suite complete with a dressing room, en-suite bathroom, and sauna, along with two additional bedrooms—one of which is en-suite. Additional amenities include a spacious lounge and dining area, a guest cloakroom, several large terraces, a fully equipped modern kitchen, private elevator access, underfloor heating throughout, mosquito nets ‌in ‌all ‌doors, ‌Gira ‌domotic ‌system, electric ‌courtains and ‌underground parking for two vehicles, ‌all ‌integrated ‌with ‌advanced ‌domotic systems. The complex ‌boasts ‌a ‌heated ‌pool ‌and ‌24/7 ‌guards."},"features":{"es":["Primera línea de Golf","Cerca de Colegios","Suroeste","Excelente","Comunitaria","Con Calefacción","Aire Acondicionado","Chimenea","Mar","Montaña","Golf","Panorámicas","Jardín","Piscina","Terraza Cubierta","Ascensor","Armarios Empotrados","Terraza Privada","TV Satélite ","Gimnasio","Lavadero","Suelos de Mármol","Doble acristalamiento","Parcialmente Equipada","Comunitario","Persianas Eléctricas","Portero Automático","Alarma","Seguridad 24 Horas","Más de uno","Privado","Teléfono","Golf"],"en":["Frontline Golf","Close To Schools","South West","Excellent","Communal","Heated","Air Conditioning","Fireplace","Sea","Mountain","Golf","Panoramic","Garden","Pool","Covered Terrace","Lift","Fitted Wardrobes","Private Terrace","Satellite TV","Gym","Utility Room","Marble Flooring","Double Glazing","Partially Fitted","Communal","Electric Blinds","Entry Phone","Alarm System","24 Hour Security","More Than One","Private","Telephone","Golf"]},"piscina":true,"parking":true,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available"}